  "final_message": "The root cause was in `collect` in [billing/payments.py](/tmp/bsvc-1xfuf8e5/billing-service/billing/payments.py): it returned when no payment method existed, skipping dunning entirely. It now records a `no_payment_method` failure, which emits the event, schedules retries, and updates the subscription state.\n\nAdded a regression test covering the first failure through retry exhaustion and wrote [answer.json](/tmp/bsvc-1xfuf8e5/billing-service/answer.json). Verification: 25 tests passed; mypy passed.",
